nx\" data-identifyelement=\"482\" data-paste-core-version=\"21.0.1\" data-paste-element=\"BOX\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; -webkit-box-align: start; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\"><h2 class=\"css-16k5vxt\" data-identifyelement=\"483\" data-paste-core-version=\"21.0.1\" data-paste-element=\"HEADING\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(18, 28, 45); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; font-weight: 600; display: inline;\"><br></h2><h2 class=\"css-16k5vxt\" data-identifyelement=\"483\" data-paste-core-version=\"21.0.1\" data-paste-element=\"HEADING\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(18, 28, 45); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; font-weight: 600; display: inline;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 36px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">ERROR: 30005</span></h2></div><hr><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Possible Causes</span></strong></span></p><ul style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">The destination number you are trying to reach is unknown and may no longer exist.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">The device you are trying to reach is not on or does not have sufficient signal.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">The device cannot receive SMS (for example, the phone number belongs to a landline)</span></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">There is an issue with the mobile carrier.</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Possible Solutions</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Pay close attention to your request and double check to verify you are attempting to send messages to the correct phone number in the correct E.164 format:</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, AndaleMono, monospace; font-size: 14px;\">[+] [country code] [subscriber number including area code]</span></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">Lead Connector Support team can help investigate what went wrong with delivering your message. Please collect 3 or more examples in your SMS logs from the last 24 hours that were flagged with Error 30005, and open a support request.</span></li></ul>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000002140-managing-customer-interactions-on-connected-gbp-pages", "title": "Managing Customer Interactions on Connected GBP Pages", "folder": "Google Business Page", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403870/original/zFsH2wSftBAaniIaowoLmow1S-HZcLMnlg107d.png?1711218167", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403882/original/A9VI8SP0L2rsB9z8bl0HDGFSfN6tHqTnew24ee.png?1711218272", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403896/original/69t6FXddN1JcYcit576tD5UlhHDHoFmLXg5c55.png?1711218355", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403898/original/WjtGcT76jEGl0_3k1uG2IxzHBn-zhHYVOwdc47.png?1711218387", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403906/original/gDdv6zSkSA2w3jOnK5Qf6C-JwVjRNMJ5Jgc6c0.png?1711218441", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403935/original/2afRKnOmX5yd1IJoyfPAHFz-mRNHSDd1tg327b.png?1711218625"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">This article explains how to track assets such as messages, leads, and reviews from your connected Google Business Profile page in a sub-account.</p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\"><br></h3><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Messages\">Messages</a></li><li><a href=\"#Ratings-&amp;-Reviews\">Ratings &amp; Reviews</a></li><li><a href=\"#Contacts\">Contacts</a></li></ul><p><br></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Messages\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Messages</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\">When a customer visits your GBP page and sends a message via the chat section, the message is fetched in the connected sub-account under the Conversations page.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403870/original/zFsH2wSftBAaniIaowoLmow1S-HZcLMnlg107d.png?1711218167\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023403870\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Based on the inbound message received, you can further engage with your customer directly from your CRM (Conversations page level) by sending an outbound message.</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">The message will also display the GBP page name from where it was initiated. This feature is particularly useful in identifying the specific business page a customer is reaching out from, especially if you have multiple business pages connected to the sub-account.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403882/original/A9VI8SP0L2rsB9z8bl0HDGFSfN6tHqTnew24ee.png?1711218272\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155023403882\"></p><p><br></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Ratings-&amp;-Reviews\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Ratings &amp; Reviews</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\">When you receive a review from a customer, the review data is accessible on the Reviews page under the Reputation module. Here, you can view, track, and respond to reviews received from the connected Google Business pages to your sub-account.</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Each review also indicates the business page name on which it was received, which is crucial when managing multiple pages connected to the sub-account.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403896/original/69t6FXddN1JcYcit576tD5UlhHDHoFmLXg5c55.png?1711218355\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023403896\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">If multiple pages are connected to a sub-account, you can configure the reviews link for each one and select a primary page. This allows you to send your contacts a review request link to gather more Google reviews for your business.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">This configuration is available from the Reputation Management tab within the Sub-Account Settings module.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403898/original/WjtGcT76jEGl0_3k1uG2IxzHBn-zhHYVOwdc47.png?1711218387\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023403898\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Contacts\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Contacts</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\">You can view the contact or lead record created from messages or reviews for your connected GBP pages within the Contacts module.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403906/original/gDdv6zSkSA2w3jOnK5Qf6C-JwVjRNMJ5Jgc6c0.png?1711218441\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023403906\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Click on a contact to visit their details page, where you can find the source and page details from where the contact was generated.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403935/original/2afRKnOmX5yd1IJoyfPAHFz-mRNHSDd1tg327b.png?1711218625\" style=\"width: 306px;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155023403935\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004673-lc-wordpress-plugin-fixing-cron-jobs-crashing-issue", "title": "LC WordPress Plugin | Fixing Cron Jobs/Crashing Issue", "folder": "WordPress Folder", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042057299/original/3rjzw4zQMymtRZTB65J4-lVWM-5LXdCqbA166e.png?1740207689", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042056236/original/EBXLYvhn0ZLkqQZPubZXqVulZkrMSsjs4Qedf3.png?1740203382", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042056328/original/ORRvhofyWnfFf_IhBC_BTFBwOVSKHqhGRQ7ea6.png?1740203505", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042057167/original/ISdT5rL5KKX3WdzXT3QmQ0Px3vxT7lWxcg75f8.png?1740207101", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042057184/original/bMfQb3760iADRVCzJxEeBOMz4MK2bl6ZlQb2c1.png?1740207198", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042057277/original/6q8NM7WEeN_WC1f6pkj01BVxGMeHJ_bqFQ2775.png?1740207504"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"531\" dir=\"ltr\">For Resolving the LC Plugin creating too many cron jobs/crashing your website please follow the steps provided below.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"532\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"533\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"534\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"535\" dir=\"ltr\">Step 1 - &nbsp;</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"536\" dir=\"ltr\">Deactivate the LC plugin by going to Plugins -&gt; Installed Plugins. <em data-identifyelement=\"537\">Skip if already in Inactive state.</em><br data-identifyelement=\"538\"><br data-identifyelement=\"539\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042057299/original/3rjzw4zQMymtRZTB65J4-lVWM-5LXdCqbA166e.png?1740207689\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042057299\" data-identifyelement=\"540\"><br data-identifyelement=\"541\"><br data-identifyelement=\"542\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"543\" dir=\"ltr\">Step 2 -&nbsp;</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"544\"><br data-identifyelement=\"545\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"546\" dir=\"ltr\">Download the leadconnector-cron-fix plugin by clicking <a data-identifyelement=\"547\" href=\"https://2ly.link/24UnG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"548\">here</strong></a><br><br>( MD5 Checksum - 5a80c8666c97f834392a0465726c219a )</p><p data-identifyelement=\"546\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"546\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"546\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"550\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"551\" dir=\"ltr\">Step 3 -&nbsp;</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"552\"><br data-identifyelement=\"553\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\">Install the new plugin by going to Plugins -&gt; Add new plugin -&gt; Upload plugin.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"555\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"556\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"557\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042056236/original/EBXLYvhn0ZLkqQZPubZXqVulZkrMSsjs4Qedf3.png?1740203382\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042056236\" data-identifyelement=\"558\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"559\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"560\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"561\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"562\">Step 4 -&nbsp;</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"563\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"564\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"565\" dir=\"ltr\">Next Click on Activate Plugin.<br data-identifyelement=\"566\"><br data-identifyelement=\"567\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042056328/original/ORRvhofyWnfFf_IhBC_BTFBwOVSKHqhGRQ7ea6.png?1740203505\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042056328\" data-identifyelement=\"568\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"569\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"570\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"571\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"572\">Step 5 -</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"573\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"574\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"575\" dir=\"ltr\">After activating the plugin Go to Tools -&gt; LC Cron Fixer</p><p data-identifyelement=\"576\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"577\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"578\" dir=\"ltr\">If you see this screen you are good to activate the main LC Plugin now<br data-identifyelement=\"579\"><br data-identifyelement=\"580\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042057167/original/ISdT5rL5KKX3WdzXT3QmQ0Px3vxT7lWxcg75f8.png?1740207101\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042057167\" data-identifyelement=\"581\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"582\"><br data-identifyelement=\"583\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"584\" dir=\"ltr\">or if you see this screen you can click on the \"fix cron jobs\" button.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"585\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"586\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"587\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042057184/original/bMfQb3760iADRVCzJxEeBOMz4MK2bl6ZlQb2c1.png?1740207198\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042057184\" data-identifyelement=\"588\"><br data-identifyelement=\"589\"><br data-identifyelement=\"590\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"591\"><u data-identifyelement=\"592\">if incase you do not see the first screen after multiple attempts please reach out to LeadConnector Support we will help you resolve the issue further.</u></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"593\"><br data-identifyelement=\"594\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"595\"><br data-identifyelement=\"596\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"597\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"598\">Step 6 -</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"599\"><br data-identifyelement=\"600\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"601\" dir=\"ltr\">Go Back to Plugins -&gt; List Plugins and click on Activate against LC Plugin. ( If incase your plugin is not on the latest version please do update the same aswell.<br data-identifyelement=\"602\"><br data-identifyelement=\"603\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042057277/original/6q8NM7WEeN_WC1f6pkj01BVxGMeHJ_bqFQ2775.png?1740207504\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042057277\" data-identifyelement=\"604\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"605\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"606\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"607\">Step 7 -</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"608\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"609\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"610\" dir=\"ltr\">Lastly Deactivate and Delete the Lead Connector Cron Fix Plugin and you are all set!</p><p data-identifyelement=\"611\"><br data-identifyelement=\"612\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"613\"><br data-identifyelement=\"614\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"615\"><br data-identifyelement=\"616\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"617\"><br data-identifyelement=\"618\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"619\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"620\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"621\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"622\"><br data-identifyelement=\"623\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"624\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"625\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000002485-configuring-conversion-api-events", "title": "Steps to Create Your Access Token", "folder": "Events", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">Enhance your event tracking by sending automatically triggered standard events directly to Facebook\u2019s servers, bypassing browser limitations and ad-blockers.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br>This powerful feature, known as Conversion API enables seamless event tracking, allows you to send all events using both the browser and the Conversion API.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\">Steps to Create Your Access Token</h2><p><br></p><ol><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Open Events Manager:</strong><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Access the top menu, click to open it, and select \u201cEvents Manager\u201d.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Alternatively, you can directly navigate to: <a href=\"https://business.facebook.com/events_manager/\">Facebook Events Manager</a>.</li></ul></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Locate Your Pixel Settings:</strong><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on your Pixel ID.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">In the left side menu, click on \u201cSettings\u201d.</li></ul></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Create Your Access Token:</strong><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Scroll down to the \"Server-Side API for Web\" section.</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\">Click on \"Create Access Token\" and follow the instructions.</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\">You will be prompted to select the pixel, create or select an app, and create or select a user.</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\">A token will be generated. Click on the token to copy it.</p></li></ul></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">With your access token, you can now configure Conversion API events for robust and reliable event tracking on your website.</p><p><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006845-video-element-in-email-builder", "title": "Video Element in Email Builder", "folder": "Email Builder Capabilities", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345327/original/mApm1B6ZS-tjUuBrjosfDjuk5KgDEUu2AAe40e.jpg?1761937216", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345330/original/IYAbSFqBfQpBUShzdjH8UW7EjuhPK0vxZQe40e.jpg?1761937216", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345328/original/aQZLX_222BpbCCDWi5Lps1PZQbsFhr0QGwaaa1.jpg?1761937217", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345323/original/iYD4eFJcvlue11b5mcDMPcYN3v4KezQtSg258f.jpg?1761937215", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345325/original/zxsdcxc7et0AcQcp9vn3t3GaXJOUp6rsLAe40e.jpg?1761937216", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345324/original/JCUUFNSOKZJTS3g8Z4w3Kw9cfsdzkagpUw258f.jpg?1761937215", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345326/original/Arh7_ozopSa8a9CWc-7Oko66dNiwgkhNXAe40e.jpg?1761937216"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-end=\"659\" data-start=\"265\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Embedding videos in emails can be tricky due to limitations in email client support. The <strong data-end=\"379\" data-start=\"362\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Video element</strong> solves this by letting you insert clickable video thumbnails that link to your video content. This article explains how to use the Video element in the Email Builder, including how to choose video types, customize thumbnails, and adjust layout settings for the best presentation.</span></p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></span></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/48001202776?portalId=48000045315#What-Is-the-Video-Element-in-Email-Builder?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">What Is the Video Element in Email Builder?</a><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/48001202776?portalId=48000045315#How-to-Find-the-Video-Element\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></a></span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/48001202776?portalId=48000045315#How-to-Find-the-Video-Element\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">How to 