ot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">What Is the Video Element in Email Builder?</strong></span></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><p data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"718\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">The <strong data-end=\"739\" data-start=\"722\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Video element</strong> in your Email Builder allows you to add a video preview inside your emails. While true video playback isn't supported in email clients, this element creates a clickable thumbnail with a play button that links directly to your video.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-e2ee8981-c079-44aa-ae05-b2a3db8b2a1f\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 1em; overflow-wrap: break