2371826\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 363px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004358-remediate-spam-likely-on-your-caller-id-using-voice-integrity", "title": "Remediate &#39;Spam Likely&#39; on your Caller ID using Voice Integrity", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155037877083/original/3SK__tDnvD0cWq1Avq1vXvH_Wvdm_13vfQa58a.jpg?1733481595"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">In this article, we will learn how we can increase our call answer rates by remediating 'spam likely' / 'potential spam' / 'scam likely' on the caller ID in the US (US only).</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">If the phone number flagged as 'spam likely' is relatively new or not critical to your business or has a FTC complaint, we recommend trashing the phone number and getting a new one. It's faster, easier and more convenient for you as compared to remediating the 'spam likely' tag.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"91\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">If you have an EIN and your number is flagged as <strong data-end=\"247\" data-start=\"230\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">\u2018Spam Likely\u2019</strong>, we recommend registering through <strong data-end=\"301\" data-start=\"282\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Voice Integrity</strong>, available in the portal. For full steps, see our article: <a href=\"48001231670-why-are-my-calls-marked-as-spam-and-how-can-i-avoid-it.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Why are my Calls marked as Spam and how can I avoid it</a></p><p data-end=\"768\" data-start=\"563\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">If you <strong data-end=\"591\" data-start=\"570\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">don\u2019t have an EIN</strong>, we suggest registering your number with the Free Caller Registry instead.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><hr><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">What is Voice Integrity?</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-size: 14px;\">Voice Integrity is a game-changing feature that helps protect your business calls from being flagged as \u201cSpam Likely.\u201d By registering your U.S.-based phone numbers with top caller ID analytics providers\u2014First Orion, Hiya, and TNS\u2014you can improve pickup rates and reinforce your brand\u2019s trustworthiness.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h1 data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"462\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Why Turn On Voice Integrity?</strong></span></h1><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><p data-end=\"524\" data-start=\"449\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">If your business numbers are flagged or blocked, Voice Integrity helps you:</span></p><ul data-end=\"785\" data-start=\"526\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"605\" data-start=\"526\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"605\" data-start=\"528\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"551\" data-start=\"528\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Fix bad reputations</strong> and clear \u201cSpam Likely\u201d labels from legitimate calls.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"606\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"608\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"633\" data-start=\"608\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Increase pickup rates</strong>\u2014recipients are more likely to answer when your caller ID shows a verified, trusted name.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"785\" data-start=\"723\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"785\" data-start=\"725\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"768\" data-start=\"725\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Ensure your calls are seen as authentic</strong>, not suspicious.</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-end=\"1207\" data-section-id=\"j76nm2\" data-start=\"1172\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-end=\"1207\" data-start=\"1175\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">What You Need to Get Started</span></strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"1279\" data-start=\"1209\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Before activating Voice Integrity, ensure you meet these requirements:</span></p><ul data-end=\"1633\" data-start=\"1281\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2rem; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;; font-size: 16px !important;\"><li data-end=\"1380\" data-start=\"1281\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1380\" data-start=\"1283\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"1312\" data-start=\"1283\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">SHAKEN/STIR Certification</strong> (Required):<br data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1327\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Confirms your calls are legitimate and not spoofed.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"1494\" data-start=\"1382\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1494\" data-start=\"1384\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"1405\" data-start=\"1384\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">CNAM Registration</strong> (Recommended):<br data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1423\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Displays your business name as the caller ID, increasing credibility.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"1633\" data-start=\"1496\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1633\" data-start=\"1498\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">U.S. Phone Numbers Only: Currently, Voice Integrity applies only to U.S.-based numbers. International traffic is not supported.<br><br><br><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\">Note</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">-&nbsp;</span><strong data-end=\"145\" data-start=\"52\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\">An EIN (Employer Identification Number) is required to complete SHAKEN/STIR registration</span>.</strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;If you don\u2019t have an EIN, we recommend registering your number with the Free Caller Registry instead.</span><br><br><br></p></li></ul><hr><h1 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 2em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">What is Free Caller Registry?</h1><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Carriers like AT&amp;T, T-Mobile and Verizon use analytics engines to generate and maintain spam scores for caller IDs. These 3 carriers have different analytics engines. All the 3 analytics engines partnered to create Free Caller Registry where you can submit a single request and all of them will re-consider the 'spam likely' tag on your caller ID.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 2em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">How to submit a request on Free Caller Registry?</h1><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Go to <a href=\"https://www.freecallerregistry.com/fcr/#submitform\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); user-select: auto;\" target=\"_blank\">Free Caller Registry</a></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Click on 'Register Here'</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Fill out this information to the best of your knowledge&nbsp;<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155037877083/original/3SK__tDnvD0cWq1Avq1vXvH_Wvdm_13vfQa58a.jpg?1733481595\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155037877083\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">The recommended values for some fields have been shown in the screenshot above. They're also listed below:<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Display name (beside Phone Number): blank</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">I believe my calls are: Other</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Service Providers: Twilio</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Please provide further information if you have received specific feedback ... : blank</li></ol></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Click 'Submit'</li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Within 4 business days, the spam flag should be removed. If it is NOT, then you can re-submit this on Free Caller Registry or try submitting it directly on the 3 analytics engines. Their links are stated below:</p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Hiya (AT&amp;T): <a href=\"https://hiyahelp.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/requests/new?ticket_form_id=824667\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(