/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286546010/original/2oXC501R-I5PNsXrie2JGBp-Q1DkpsUjgQ9425.png?1678462805"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"tdfocus-1677520564596\" data-identifyelement=\"1004\" dir=\"ltr\">Facebook Conversions API aims to connect your marketing data directly with Funnels and Workflows in LeadConnector and Facebook Meta that help optimize ad targeting, decrease cost per result, and measure outcomes. With Facebook Conversion API, you can collect the people who are more likely relevant audiences for running your ads for retargeting. It is a setup for your business to upload server events for your web traffic.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1677520564596\" data-identifyelement=\"1004\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1009\"></p><h4 class=\"fd-toc\" data-identifyelement=\"1025\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1026\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1027\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Covered in this Article:</span></strong></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1028\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1029\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1030\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-is-the-difference-between-Funnel-Events-and-Lead-Events-in-Facebook-Conversion-API?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1031\">What is the difference between Funnel Events and Lead Events in Facebook Conversion API?</strong></a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1032\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1033\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1034\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-set-up-FB-CAPI-(Conversions-API)-Lead-Event?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1035\" dir=\"ltr\">How to set up FB CAPI (Conversions API) Lead Event?</strong></a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1036\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1037\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1038\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Step-1%3A-Create-an-FB-Pixel%3A\">Step 1: Create an FB Pixel:</a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1039\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1040\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1041\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Step-2%3A-Create-two-FB-Conversions-API-Workflows.\">Step 2: Create two FB Conversions API Workflows.</a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1042\" style=\"margin-left: 40px; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1043\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1044\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Workflow--1-to-Create/Update-Opportunity\">Workflow -1 to Create/Update Opportunity</a></span></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1045\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1046\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Workflow--2-to-send-Conversion-data-to-FB-Conversion-API\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1047\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Workflow -2 to send Conversion data to FB Conversion API</span></a></h4><hr data-identifyelement=\"1010\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1677520648676\" data-identifyelement=\"1011\" id=\"What-is-the-difference-between-Funnel-Events-and-Lead-Events-in-Facebook-Conversion-API?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1677677621624\" data-identifyelement=\"1012\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What is the difference between Funnel Events and Lead Events in Facebook Conversion API?</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"1028\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1029\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1677677659377\" data-identifyelement=\"1030\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">In LeadConnector, we support two types of Facebook Conversion API.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1031\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1032\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1677677665239\" data-identifyelement=\"1033\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1034\">Funnel Events</strong> - The events are sent from a web server to record the events when the user visits the page, adds products to a cart, purchase, subscribe, submit an application, and more. To learn more about how to set up Funnel Event Pixel using FB CAPI, <a class=\"tdfocus-1681046249000\" data-identifyelement=\"1014\" href=\"48001237084-how-to-set-up-a-funnel-event-pixel-for-facebook-conversion-api-a1bb.html?nocache=true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1048\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">please read this article.</span></a></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1680030248218\" data-identifyelement=\"1035\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1036\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1677677672352\" data-identifyelement=\"1037\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1038\">Lead Events</strong> - The LeadConnector CRM sends the events with how the Lead moves across the pipeline stages. For example, a Business creates a pipeline name Lead Generation. The leads are moving across the pipeline stages, from new leads to booked or abandoned ones. With Lead events, LeadConnector CRM sends the data to Facebook Conversion API - with CRM being the data source.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1677677672352\" data-identifyelement=\"1037\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1016\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1677677672352\" data-identifyelement=\"1037\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1017\" dir=\"ltr\">Conversion Leads -&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1679507280644\" data-identifyelement=\"1037\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Facebook conversion leads integration helps your Facebook lead ads <span class=\"tdfocus-1680797812672\" data-identifyelement=\"1049\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Instant Forms&nbsp;</span>optimize for the quality of leads instead of the volume of leads. When users submit the Instant form, their contact information is captured and synced in the CRM. This contact information can then be used to follow up with the leads to nurture them and move them further down the sales funnel. As each Lead moves through the sales funnel, the Conversion leads integration allows the advertiser to share the lead status with Meta, which allows Meta to optimize the lead ad for increased lead-to-sales Conversion. will enable</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1038\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1039\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1677677672352\" data-identifyelement=\"1037\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1027\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1039\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1040\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1050\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Guidelines to ensure your business is a good fit for the Conversion Leads integration:</p><ul class=\"tdfocus-1679940331188\" data-identifyelement=\"1042\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"1043\">Use Facebook/Instagram Lead Ads (Instant Forms) [Facebook form field mapping inside LeadConnector is used]</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1044\">Ensure the 15-16 digit Meta Lead ID is mapped to your CRM</li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677677721890\" data-identifyelement=\"1045\">Generate at least 250 leads per month</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1046\">Can upload data regularly at least once per day</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1047\">The lead stage you want to optimize for occurs within 28 days of leads being generated</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1048\" dir=\"ltr\">The lead stage you want to optimize for has a 1% - 40% conversion rate.</li></ul><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1677520648676\" data-identifyelement=\"1011\" id=\"\"><br data-identifyelement=\"997\"></h2><hr data-identifyelement=\"998\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1677520648676\" data-identifyelement=\"1011\" id=\"How-to-set-up-FB-CAPI-(Conversions-API)-Lead-Event?\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1677677621624\" data-identifyelement=\"1012\" dir=\"ltr\">How to set up FB CAPI (Conversions API) Lead Event?</strong></h2><h3 data-identifyelement=\"1013\" id=\"Step-1:-Create-an-FB-Pixel:\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1677520708563\" data-identifyelement=\"1014\" dir=\"ltr\">Step 1: Create an FB Pixel:</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1015\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1016\"></p><ol class=\"tdfocus-1677521207872\" data-identifyelement=\"1017\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1677520712675\" data-identifyelement=\"1018\" dir=\"ltr\">Please start creating a pixel by going to your <a class=\"tdfocus-1681046290785\" data-identifyelement=\"1019\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"http://business.facebook.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook Business Manager (also called the Meta Business Suite)</a> &gt; Head over to the left and then the<span data-identifyelement=\"1051\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"tdfocus-1677678029041\" data-identifyelement=\"1022\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1052\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\"><a class=\"tdfocus-1677678054098\" data-identifyelement=\"1050\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events_manager2/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Events Manager</a></span>&nbsp;</strong>tab.</li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677520712675\" data-identifyelement=\"1026\" dir=\"ltr\">Ensure you are connected to the correct Ad Account with all the required Access to that FB Page.<br data-identifyelement=\"1053\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284070737/original/AFb9bOXlqhbRRlui5ZOjvh_Ry7MYiUeFaQ9ca9.png?1677521079\" style=\"width: 532px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284070737\" data-identifyelement=\"1028\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1054\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1030\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677520712675\" data-identifyelement=\"1031\" dir=\"ltr\">Head over to the left sidebar and then click on <strong class=\"tdfocus-1677521365063\" data-identifyelement=\"1032\" dir=\"ltr\">Connect Data Sources<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284518426/original/vpJQuXlQ-fkLtQlkuMXpv-MYw6ymdVS3Ug5f0f.png?1677678141\" style=\"width: 522px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1681046327648\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284518426\" data-identifyelement=\"1053\"></strong></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677520712675\" data-identifyelement=\"1034\" dir=\"ltr\">Choose <strong data-identifyelement=\"1035\" dir=\"ltr\">CRM&nbsp;</strong>in the options that show up, and then hit <strong data-identifyelement=\"1036\" dir=\"ltr\">Connect.</strong><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284071479/original/xefmOQbqFZ5OIXwwokxwojclMFUPmsqMgg8352.png?1677521389\" style=\"width: 566px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1677521394743\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284071479\" data-identifyelement=\"1037\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1055\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1056\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677678242425\" data-identifyelement=\"1054\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1055\" dir=\"ltr\">Please Note</strong><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1677678199697\" data-identifyelement=\"1056\" dir=\"ltr\">If you are looking to send a Funnel Event using Facebook CAPI from LeadConnector for funnel events, select the web option here for recording the events.</pre><p data-identifyelement=\"1057\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1058\"></p></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677681976477\" data-identifyelement=\"1057\" dir=\"ltr\">It will show you a popup with Best Practices and a button to click <strong class=\"tdfocus-1677521534852\" data-identifyelement=\"1041\" dir=\"ltr\">Next.&nbsp;</strong>The Best Practices are Facebook suggestions on how to utilize this capability best. Click on <strong data-identifyelement=\"1042\" dir=\"ltr\">Next&nbsp;</strong>to proceed.<strong class=\"tdfocus-1677521534852\" data-identifyelement=\"1043\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284071842/original/h2oYqzg70vxwTCK0nhUngOl5xMlDckMaJg4398.png?1677521528\" style=\"width: 536px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1681046339390\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284071842\" data-identifyelement=\"1044\"></strong></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677520712675\" data-identifyelement=\"1047\" dir=\"ltr\">Click on <strong class=\"tdfocus-1677771015730\" data-identifyelement=\"1048\" dir=\"ltr\">Create New Pixel&nbsp;</strong>or Use an existing pixel from the list for collecting the data. Click <strong data-identifyelement=\"1058\">Continue</strong> when the pixel details are added.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284072690/original/qgMYOqAYudCL0t2rtYthWAkL4dYkgKtGTwa87a.png?1677521908\" style=\"width: 532px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284072690\" data-identifyelement=\"1049\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1059\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1060\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677520712675\" data-identifyelement=\"1055\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1677523792703\" data-identifyelement=\"1056\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</strong>It will take you to your FB Events Manager&gt; <strong data-identifyelement=\"1059\">Data Sources&gt; Settings</strong>.<br data-identifyelement=\"1061\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284082779/original/89nNGLDYELlJ8JafKn7S3j0a6pDsRUoLjA3925.png?1677526059\" style=\"width: 530px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284082779\" data-identifyelement=\"1058\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1062\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1043\">Hit <strong data-identifyelement=\"1060\" dir=\"ltr\">Continue</strong> in front of <strong data-identifyelement=\"1061\" dir=\"ltr\">Choose Your CRM</strong><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284077467/original/XbDBEbRH2zr1RvdA7bB2TIyLU185VR0o1w7880.png?1677523873\" style=\"width: 527px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284077467\" data-identifyelement=\"1062\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1063\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1064\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677520712675\" data-identifyelement=\"1065\" dir=\"ltr\">Search for LeadConnector in the search bar, and choose LeadConnector from the dropdown:<br data-identifyelement=\"1064\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284078270/original/Duh85GlHa-WFW4YqBSbPJ-Dl-_HG5-B0BAf1ad.png?1677524212\" style=\"width: 526px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284078270\" data-identifyelement=\"1067\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1065\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1069\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677520712675\" data-identifyelement=\"1070\" dir=\"ltr\">Select <strong data-identifyelement=\"1071\" dir=\"ltr\">Use a third-party partner to connect in a few steps (no coding required),&nbsp;</strong>then choose <strong data-identifyelement=\"1072\" dir=\"ltr\">LeadConnector</strong>. Then click on <strong data-identifyelement=\"1073\" dir=\"ltr\">Go to Partner&nbsp;</strong>to proceed.<br data-identifyelement=\"1066\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284079246/original/iHOXn0pJLlidnUuDmTV7dyis5KpBkavXIAe6df.png?1677524607\" style=\"width: 528px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1677524611531\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284079246\" data-identifyelement=\"1075\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1067\">It will ask you to grant LeadConnector permission to connect with your Facebook Conversions API, and then your CRM should be connected.<br data-identifyelement=\"1068\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1069\"></li></ol><p class=\"tdfocus-1677524989081\" data-identifyelement=\"1076\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1028\" dir=\"ltr\">Please Note</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1677771195609\" data-identifyelement=\"1029\" dir=\"ltr\">Prerequisite for Facebook CAPI - Lead Events<br data-identifyelement=\"1030\">1. In CRM, please go to Settings &gt; Integration &gt; Check the Facebook account is connected with admin permissions. Please ensure that your FB Business Page, which you are an admin of and have all access to, <a class=\"tdfocus-1681046365167\" data-identifyelement=\"1082\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"48001237082-facebook-lead-ad-integration-troubleshooting-guide.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1681046416286\" data-identifyelement=\"1070\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">is integrated and the correct FB lead Form is mapped in your CRM account.</span></a><br data-identifyelement=\"1031\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1032\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286543223/original/n0p0uk19dTqvfrWV5W8Mdih89QFX0KJQjw8841.png?1678462195\" style=\"width: 524px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48286543223\" data-identifyelement=\"1033\">&nbsp;<br data-identifyelement=\"1034\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286543401/original/iXrLt7Xp2xR1eJl1IT7d6vHsI8ZnYeRBgwd9c7.png?1678462227\" style=\"width: 532px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1678462199730\" data-id=\"48286543401\" data-identifyelement=\"1035\">2. In Facebook From Field Mapping, the form should be mapped correctly and the status should be enabled. Facebook form mapping has moved under location settings &gt; integrations &gt; Facebook Form Field Mapping. <a class=\"tdfocus-1681046404471\" data-identifyelement=\"1048\" href=\"48001237082-facebook-lead-ad-integration-troubleshooting-guide.html#Supported-custom-fields-when-using-Facebook-Lead-Ads%3A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1071\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Here is a list of the supported custom fields</span></a> which include multiple and single option custom fields as well.<br data-identifyelement=\"1049\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1072\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48291755645/original/56BY1UUCTEjpcu59cWIfUX9TBVKhun0qpA62c7.gif?1681046482\" style=\"width: 567px;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48291755645\" data-identifyelement=\"1073\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/48000987779-facebook-lead-ad-integration-troubleshooting-guide#Supported-custom-fields-when-using-Facebook-Lead-Ads%3A:~:text=Facebook%20form%20mapping%20has%20moved%20under%20location%20settings%20%3E%20integrations%20%3E%20Facebook%20Form%20Field%20Mapping\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" dir=\"ltr\" data-identifyelement=\"1052\"></a><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286543798/original/TN-M497JjRU1QI1H-NwXVq1r1vWxdBHPWw034f.png?1678462304\" style=\"width: 571px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1678462257585\" data-id=\"48286543798\" data-identifyelement=\"1036\"></pre><p class=\"tdfocus-1677524989081\" data-identifyelement=\"1076\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1077\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1677525007547\" data-identifyelement=\"1078\" id=\"Step-2:-Create-two-FB-Conversions-API-Workflows.\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1677520708563\" data-identifyelement=\"1079\" dir=\"ltr\">Step 2: Create two FB Conversions API Workflows.</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1053\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1054\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1678806069523\" data-identifyelement=\"1055\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1056\" dir=\"ltr\">Please Note</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1678806089841\" data-identifyelement=\"1057\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1058\">You need to create Two Workflows for this process to work effectively.</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1059\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1060\">The first workflow focuses on generating leads and adding them to the correct pipeline with an Create/Update Opportunity Action. Once a lead is captured, it is important to ensure that it is properly tagged and categorized in the correct Pipeline and Stage so that it can be effectively managed and tracked as it moves through your sales funnel.<br data-identifyelement=\"1061\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1062\">The second workflow focuses on triggering events for Facebook conversion leads. The goal of this workflow is to get fired off by a lead being moved to a specific pipeline stage and then a Facebook Conversions API workflow action pushing them to FB CAPI.<br data-identifyelement=\"1063\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1064\">By combining these two workflows, you can create a comprehensive lead generation and management system that is optimized for Facebook conversion leads. This can help you generate more qualified leads, convert more customers, and grow your business over time.</pre><p data-identifyelement=\"1065\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1066\"></p><ol class=\"tdfocus-1677527777264\" data-identifyelement=\"1080\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1677524989081\" data-identifyelement=\"1081\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">To send a CRM event from your CRM, you need to create a workflow that does that. For now, you can navigate away from the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1066\" dir=\"ltr\">FB Events Manager&gt; Data Sources&gt; Settings (but keep it open in a tab in your browser)</strong>and head over to your CRM account.<h4 data-identifyelement=\"1067\" id=\"Workflow--1-to-Create/Update-Opportunity\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284081045/original/r6dBGPrK4R-SDzJJARAeMGvHU6SwuwwTog5eae.png?1677525316\" style=\"width: 599px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1677525587306\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284081045\" data-identifyelement=\"1084\"><u class=\"tdfocus-1678462703293\" data-identifyelement=\"1037\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1038\"></u><u data-identifyelement=\"1040\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1678462710990\" data-identifyelement=\"1041\" dir=\"ltr\">Workflow -1 to Create/Update Opportunity</strong></u></h4><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1068\" id=\"-1\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1069\"></h4>Once the FB page is integrated correctly in sub-account settings, go to your <strong data-identifyelement=\"1087\" dir=\"ltr\">Automations&gt; Workflows&nbsp;</strong><strong class=\"tdfocus-1677527777665\" data-identifyelement=\"1088\" dir=\"ltr\">&gt;Create a new Workflow.</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1074\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1045\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1677527777665\" data-identifyelement=\"1088\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286546010/original/2oXC501R-I5PNsXrie2JGBp-Q1DkpsUjgQ9425.png?1678462805\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1681046499293\" data-id=\"48286546010\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: 587px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-identifyelement=\"1046\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286546006/original/alvpeqMJi-F-GLEN3RRI2cPSXrld3Y5O_w56a9.png?1678462804\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1681046503278\" data-id=\"48286546006\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: 585px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-identifyelement=\"1047\">&nbsp;</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1075\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1092\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1093\" dir=\"ltr\">Add a new Workflow Trigger&nbsp;</strong>in your Workflow and have it get fired off by <strong data-identifyelement=\"1094\" dir=\"ltr\">Facebook Lead Form Submitted&nbsp;</strong>(if that is the first stage of your conversions flow)<br data-identifyelement=\"1076\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1049\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286546193/original/QCoLEB86JllFreFJ5Diu7cdng-D99varngede2.png?1678462855\" style=\"width: 585px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1681046505625\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48286546193\" data-identifyelement=\"1050\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1077\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286546275/original/bIYLs5wFGFib8HHB4wVkTiCZ8LsAI4Ve5Ac097.png?1678462874\" style=\"width: 591px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1681046510047\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48286546275\" data-identifyelement=\"1052\">You can add filters to choose which specific Facebook Lead Ad form to get the Workflow to be triggered by submissions to that form only:<br data-identifyelement=\"1078\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1054\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1055\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284912934/original/heugdOwIkkCN3nHUQWQkykYEUrQ-gFxVFAa588.png?1677796877\" style=\"width: 583px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1681046512662\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284912934\" data-identifyelement=\"1056\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1079\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284913014/original/9Bu9owdEH4ngwAV5KbUA_Nv7Cb8l49bevwd5d8.png?1677796929\" style=\"width: 578px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1681046515567\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284913014\" data-identifyelement=\"1058\">And then add the action for Create or Update Opportunity.<br data-identifyelement=\"1080\">Specify the Pipeline and Pipeline Stage for this action.<br data-identifyelement=\"1081\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1060\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284912843/original/fcbO5T8hniNd4i6_tKAorIYMuq_hfXQF2wc3d6.png?1677796821\" style=\"width: 567px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1680029570755\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284912843\" data-identifyelement=\"1061\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1082\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48289810478/original/gxXyO-ikMbIEpVzT21sqwMTnLhg7m_1CPwf550.png?1680029574\" style=\"width: 567px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1681046521142\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48289810478\" data-identifyelement=\"1016\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48289810628/original/mhTqoClA-pn-nWwlJHm7NhAtejZptyDiBA9456.png?1680029620\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48289810628\" data-identifyelement=\"1017\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1083\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1019\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1020\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1021\">The Opportunity Name can be defaulted to the Lead's Full Name by using the custom value dropper:<br data-identifyelement=\"1084\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48289810842/original/6eLWKBPaElTUU6pwWKEHtpyCw7pikrndOg3db0.png?1680029713\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48289810842\" data-identifyelement=\"1023\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1085\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1025\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1026\">Toggle on Allow Duplicate Opportunities for this particular Workflow.<br data-identifyelement=\"1086\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1065\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286547801/original/2IRh7FSb8LVSD_YhLSiMnVX6P9O-GRYuMwa5f3.png?1678463117\" style=\"width: 517px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48286547801\" data-identifyelement=\"1066\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1087\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1088\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\">IMPORTANT</span></strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1089\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1068\"></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1070\"><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1677771195609\" data-identifyelement=\"1071\" dir=\"ltr\">Note - In Workflow Settings, please Allow Multiple contacts.<br data-identifyelement=\"1072\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1073\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284913229/original/ZxC5IKj5kcGr8aJ9llZd21BFfo8ebfua1g0845.png?1677797068\" style=\"width: 524px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1678463556327\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284913229\" data-identifyelement=\"1074\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1081\"></pre></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677524989081\" data-identifyelement=\"1086\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Make sure to save your actions and then save and Publish the Workflow.<br data-identifyelement=\"1090\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1028\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48289811747/original/cNyMa27nnTKziuJvBIsKE44CNNVXEKSLBgf4ff.png?1680030064\" style=\"width: 516px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48289811747\" data-identifyelement=\"1029\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1091\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1078\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286550117/original/MWJV_FDpKOSGuoKp2nAB4j22FW0GWZYCSwc5ad.png?1678463664\" style=\"width: 521px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48286550117\" data-identifyelement=\"1079\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1092\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1081\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1082\"><h4 data-identifyelement=\"1085\" id=\"Workflow--2-to-send-Conversion-data-to-FB-Conversion-API\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1678806517512\" data-identifyelement=\"1086\"><u data-identifyelement=\"1087\">Workflow -2 to send Conversion data to FB Conversion API</u></strong></h4>Create another workflow. Add the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1088\">Pipeline Stage Change</strong> trigger and a <strong data-identifyelement=\"1089\">Facebook Conversion API</strong> action.<br data-identifyelement=\"1093\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1091\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284913563/original/x6nVQu6rCGuqGi1eraGeNkm6anfS5SXrTA10d5.png?1677797220\" style=\"width: 519px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284913563\" data-identifyelement=\"1090\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284913625/original/HJDwiaFWG7nIwBKgA-a-n8ssIpyvfCFIJA8533.png?1677797259\" style=\"width: 521px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284913625\" data-identifyelement=\"1091\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284913863/original/hG8Y6bkGqBXvPSiwT5BsymoFcATYK0P-eQ779b.png?1677797379\" style=\"width: 513px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284913863\" data-identifyelement=\"1092\">Choose <strong data-identifyelement=\"1105\" dir=\"ltr\">Lead Event</strong> as the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1106\" dir=\"ltr\">Event Type</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1094\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284913927/original/RYZECNsdo5FJRAqq5VuGqI0oVmphuPGuMQ6d83.png?1677797416\" style=\"width: 517px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1680028785475\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284913927\" data-identifyelement=\"1093\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1095\">Make sure to save your actions and then save and Publish the Workflow.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48289809267/original/NJE25vxjbsGs1W81dAPerxmifAHywBIwaQ60fe.png?1680029104\" style=\"width: 512px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48289809267\" data-identifyelement=\"1030\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1096\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1095\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1098\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286550117/original/MWJV_FDpKOSGuoKp2nAB4j22FW0GWZYCSwc5ad.png?1678463664\" style=\"width: 521px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48286550117\" data-identifyelement=\"1099\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677524989081\" data-identifyelement=\"1111\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Navigate to your <strong class=\"tdfocus-1677526204651\" data-identifyelement=\"1025\" dir=\"ltr\">Facebook Events Manager&gt; Data Sources&gt; Settings&gt; Scroll down and click on Generate Access Token.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284083011/original/RwfRWhgZecEtx5n_8bJ4KJoI7xDElidJxg448b.png?1677526170\" style=\"width: 521px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284083011\" data-identifyelement=\"1026\"></strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1097\">Copy the generated Access Token.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284083404/original/bHK53D95m_c3ncnPCMPnmMRzFZwGImFefA2938.png?1677526360\" style=\"width: 521px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1677526335369\" data-id=\"48284083404\" data-identifyelement=\"1028\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677524989081\" data-identifyelement=\"1111\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Paste it in the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1029\" dir=\"ltr\">Access Token&nbsp;</strong>field of your Workflow's FB Conversion API Action.<br data-identifyelement=\"1098\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284914111/original/9VLCelzYHWuoWc60Vc70ngi9Fz6FDjHZOg6c9f.png?1677797522\" style=\"width: 532px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284914111\" data-identifyelement=\"1101\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1099\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1033\"></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677524989081\" data-identifyelement=\"1111\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Navigate to your <strong class=\"tdfocus-1677526204651\" data-identifyelement=\"1034\" dir=\"ltr\">Facebook Events Manager&gt; Data Sources&gt; Settings&gt; Scroll down and copy your Pixel ID.</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1100\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1677526204651\" data-identifyelement=\"1036\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284083951/original/E5sstzualqyZTzkOPdRidoKqw9sAFz0YaQ14a0.png?1677526654\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1677526647850\" data-id=\"48284083951\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: 537px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-identifyelement=\"1037\"></strong></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677524989081\" data-identifyelement=\"1111\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1677526204651\" data-identifyelement=\"1039\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</strong>Paste the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1040\" dir=\"ltr\">Pixel ID</strong> in the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1041\" dir=\"ltr\">Pixel ID&nbsp;</strong>field in your Workflow's <strong data-identifyelement=\"1042\" dir=\"ltr\">FB Conversion API Action.&nbsp;</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1101\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1681046542201\" data-identifyelement=\"1044\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284914151/original/XROx-MtmbjcQ-0iQe0z1L-5Ba3AxacUTzgf7ec.png?1677797557\" style=\"width: 543px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284914151\" data-identifyelement=\"1102\"><p data-identifyelement=\"1102\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1103\"></p>&nbsp;</strong></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677524989081\" data-identifyelement=\"1111\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Fill in the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1046\" dir=\"ltr\">Stage Name;&nbsp;</strong>it should accurately represent your Pipeline and Pipeline Stage name for better reporting. Select it using the tag icon at the end to add the custom value of the opportunity pipeline and stages. Save the Action, save and Publish the Workflow<br data-identifyelement=\"1104\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284914422/original/elCtHmZ8BT5Q3vXnUtgdhsmSHZfrDNYm5w1e4e.png?1677797736\" style=\"width: 543px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284914422\" data-identifyelement=\"1104\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284914455/original/gOIy3oLHfVqEUAzKmxvBnlmNly_2NXYgww3485.png?1677797768\" style=\"width: 541px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284914455\" data-identifyelement=\"1105\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1105\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1102\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1081\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1677681764062\" data-identifyelement=\"1082\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Save the Action, <strong data-identifyelement=\"1031\">Save&nbsp;</strong>and <strong data-identifyelement=\"1032\">Publish&nbsp;</strong>the Workflow.</span><br data-identifyelement=\"1106\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1034\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1677681764062\" data-identifyelement=\"1082\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48289807621/original/rWwzj05pUY2_7sFeDhLxXsiVCoXKKRpPKg0c30.png?1680028476\" style=\"width: 534px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48289807621\" data-identifyelement=\"1035\"></span><strong data-identifyelement=\"1107\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1108\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\">IMPORTANT</span></strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1109\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1107\"></li><li data-identifyelement=\"1108\"><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1677771195609\" data-identifyelement=\"1109\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 12px 16px; display: block; cursor: pointer; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Note - In Workflow Settings, please enable <strong data-identifyelement=\"1110\" dir=\"ltr\">Allow Multiple</strong>.<br data-identifyelement=\"1111\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1112\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284914523/original/l_2ib3vbuisvYM3kwkrFC6fJvfGmEAxTiA56da.jpg?1677797816\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"48284914523\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 524px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-identifyelement=\"1113\"></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"1110\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1111\"></p></li><li class=\"tdfocus-1677524989081\" data-identifyelement=\"1111\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">You can test your Workflow using the <a class=\"tdfocus-1677681957901\" data-identifyelement=\"1051\" href=\"https://developers.facebook.com/tools/lead-ads-testing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1112\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Lead Ads Test Tool.</span></a> Choose the correct Page and Lead Ad Form, then <strong class=\"tdfocus-1677527455135\" data-identifyelement=\"1052\" dir=\"ltr\">Create a Lead.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48284085774/original/zCWJuZ-RgVmwqiVyUGkYg9sBskBWo0Oh0Qdd39.png?1677527436\" style=\"width: 543px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48284085774\" data-identifyelement=\"1053\"></strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1113\">For more details on how to use the Lead Ads Testing Tool, please <a data-identifyelement=\"1114\" href=\"48001237082-facebook-lead-ad-integration-troubleshooting-guide.html#Why-are-my-Lead-Ads-not-making-it-into-my-Sub-Account?\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1115\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">click here.</span></a><br data-identifyelement=\"1116\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1117\"></li></ol><p class=\"tdfocus-1677681796104\" data-identifyelement=\"1054\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 60px;\">The Event should be picked up by your Events Manager, who is actively waiting for Events sent by your Workflow. It takes up to a day to successfully pick up an event sent by your Workflow.<br data-identifyelement=\"1114\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1115\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1116\">Once the Event is sent from the Lead Ads Test Tool, please go to Opportunity Pipeline and move the dummy Facebook lead to another stage configured in the Work